---
system: sys-07-parent-controls-summary
flow_id: weekly-summary-generation
surface: cron
spec_anchor: /software/systems/07-parent-controls-summary#weekly-summary-worker
actors: [EventBridge, SQS, SummaryWorker, PostgreSQL, NotificationQueue]
apis: []
externals: [EventBridge, SQS]
queues:
  - controls.summary.weekly
  - controls.summary.weekly.dlq
  - tbot-notifications
failure_paths:
  - missing_daily_rows
  - upsert_constraint_violation
  - worker_timeout
  - dlq_redelivery_exhausted
idempotency: upsert ON CONFLICT (device_id, child_profile_id, iso_week)
retry: SQS 3 retries with backoff (5m, 30m, 2h); DLQ after 3 fails
timeout: 600s visibility timeout per message
status: final
---
%% HAND-CURATED. Aggregates daily_summaries → engagement trend; tolerates missing daily rows.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant EventBridge
    participant SQS as SQS controls.summary.weekly
    participant SummaryWorker
    participant PostgreSQL
    participant NotificationQueue as SQS tbot-notifications

    EventBridge->>SQS: cron(0 4 ? * MON *) enqueue {iso_week}
    SQS->>SummaryWorker: deliver message (visibility 600s)
    SummaryWorker->>PostgreSQL: SELECT daily_summaries WHERE summary_date IN week

    alt missing_daily_rows
        PostgreSQL-->>SummaryWorker: partial result (some days have no rows)
        Note over SummaryWorker: treat missing days as zero — continue
    else complete week
        PostgreSQL-->>SummaryWorker: 7 rows per pair
    end

    SummaryWorker->>PostgreSQL: SELECT previous-week weekly_summaries (for engagement_trend delta)

    Note over SummaryWorker: trend = increasing if Δ ≥ +15% — declining if Δ ≤ −15% — stable otherwise

    loop per (device_id, child_profile_id)
        alt upsert_constraint_violation
            SummaryWorker->>PostgreSQL: INSERT weekly_summaries ... ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE
            PostgreSQL-->>SummaryWorker: error
            Note over SummaryWorker: log + continue
        else upserted
            SummaryWorker->>PostgreSQL: INSERT weekly_summaries ... ON CONFLICT (device_id,child_profile_id,iso_week) DO UPDATE
            PostgreSQL-->>SummaryWorker: ok
        end
    end

    alt worker_timeout
        SummaryWorker--xSQS: > 600s visibility expired
        SQS->>SummaryWorker: redeliver
    else dlq_redelivery_exhausted
        SQS--xSQS: move to controls.summary.weekly.dlq
    else completed
        SummaryWorker->>NotificationQueue: enqueue {event: summary.weekly.generated, iso_week}
        SummaryWorker-->>SQS: ACK
    end

    Note over EventBridge,NotificationQueue: idempotent via unique (device, child, iso_week) — engagement_trend defaults to stable when prev-week total_minutes=0
